# Line endings are part of the bytes we ship and hash: the bundled filter
# lists are checked against manifest sha256s and the compiled engines are
# compared byte-for-byte (tests/unit/blocklist-artifacts.test.js). Windows
# checkouts default to CRLF conversion, which silently broke both the first
# time CI ran there. Everything text is LF on every platform; binaries are
# detected by text=auto and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.engine binary
*.png binary
*.icns binary
*.ico binary
*.dmg binary
*.zip binary
